      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OVERRIDING (1) comes off an average effort last start when seventh at The Gardens over 400m behind Zipping Vivid (23.33) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money prior to that. Has claims if he runs up to expectations. OCEAN'S PEARL (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Typhoon Lad (17.64) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Expected to be in this for a long way. KNIGHT'S CASTLE (3) last start finished 4th over 300m at this track beaten 7 lengths (17.72) behind Typhoon Lad in a Grade 4/5 on November 18. Can feature in the finish. AT THE GATE (7) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
